OL,3,ACharlotte Church closes wellness
OL,4,Aretreat after five 'beautiful' years
OL,5,
OL,6,FCharlotte Church will close her
OL,7,Fwellness retreat after five "beautiful
OL,8,Fyears", the company has announced.
OL,10,FThe Dreaming, based in Rhydoldog House
OL,11,Fnear Rhayader, Powys, offered retreats
OL,12,Faimed at helping people reconnect with
OL,13,Fnature and spirituality.
OL,15,FThe singer-songwriter bought the former
OL,16,Fhome of fashion designer Laura Ashley
OL,17,Fin 2021, with its renovation later
OL,18,Ffeaturing in a Discovery Channel
OL,19,Fdocumentary series.
OL,23,APub: 15-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
